138. REQUIRED FINAL COMMANDS
================================================================

Run:

python -m pytest -q -ra
python main.py --version
python -m build
git diff --check
git status --short

clean wheel install
zcoder --version
zcoder doctor local-ai

Run separately:

supervisor tests
model-pool tests
scheduler tests
memory-pressure tests
eviction tests
crash-recovery tests
fairness tests
tenant-isolation tests
offline E2E
zero-paid-call E2E
self-hosted Web profile

Run real local runtime/coding tests if actual model exists.

Never fabricate them.

================================================================
139. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-17 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-16 evidence is revalidated
[ ] simulated and real evidence remain separated
[ ] runtime supervisor exists
[ ] managed/external ownership differs correctly
[ ] managed runtimes recover from crash
[ ] restart loops are bounded
[ ] runtime reconciliation works
[ ] model pool exists
[ ] model residency states are explicit
[ ] duplicate model copies are prevented by default
[ ] memory admission control exists
[ ] memory pressure cannot intentionally OOM host
[ ] safe eviction exists
[ ] active model cannot be evicted
[ ] inference scheduler exists
[ ] per-model/global queues are bounded
[ ] fairness exists
[ ] cancellation works
[ ] backpressure works
[ ] warm model reuse works
[ ] model-load cost affects routing
[ ] continuous measured metrics exist
[ ] performance drift is detectable
[ ] quality regression is detectable
[ ] routing uses evidence quality
[ ] zero-paid firewall is central
[ ] paid fallback cannot bypass policy
[ ] prompt/cache tenant isolation passes
[ ] tool/MCP context isolation passes
[ ] offline E2E has zero prohibited outbound traffic
[ ] CPU-only remains supported
[ ] no Redis/Kafka/cloud service becomes mandatory
[ ] local production profile is reproducible
[ ] inherited RLS/security gates remain green

